e since 2022 in Kwamouth (Mai-Ndombe) and western Kwilu territories (notably Bagata) but is not reported to operate inside Kikwit. Urban crime (armed robbery, youth gangs) occurs but does not amount to gang control of neighbourhoods. Web research was unavailable for this run (search budget exhausted, news and search sites blocked by the proxy), so the assessment rests on default state presence."}}